  "plan": {
    "goal": "Co-incubate CYP3A4 with 4-methylumbelliferone at 4091.7 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki = 97.5 µM) at 145.7 µM and quantify the run-condition IC50, apparent Km, fractional activity and percent inhibition.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of CYP3A4-mediated 4-methylumbelliferone metabolism. Substrate [S] = 4091.7 µM, Km = 1863.6 µM, inhibitor [I] = 145.7 µM, Ki = 97.5 µM, Vmax = 0.4257 µmol/min. Under competitive inhibition the apparent Km rises to Km(1+[I]/Ki) while Vmax is unchanged; the run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff IC50 = Ki(1+[S]/Km); fractional activity = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]).",
